# Confirm Before Save

- Do not automatically write generated code into project files.
- By default, provide code in chat first and wait for explicit user confirmation.
- Only save file changes after the user clearly confirms with "keep", "apply", or equivalent approval.
- If the user asks for code changes without approval to save, show the proposed patch or code snippet instead of editing files.
